WEBVTT

00:01.520 --> 00:03.500
Seek the Empress!

00:03.920 --> 00:11.500
Word of the Prince's predicament has not yet spread widely. As his daughter-in-law, my paying respects to Mother will likely not be barred.

00:11.520 --> 00:18.000
Though Her Majesty never meddles in court politics, she will never sit idly by while her own son is led to slaughter!
